<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Online Portfolio</title>

<style>

*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
    font-family:Arial, sans-serif;
}

body{
    background:#f4f4f4;
}

.navbar{
    width:100%;
    background:#333;
    color:white;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    padding:15px 50px;
}

.logo h2{
    font-size:30px;
}

.logo p{
    font-size:12px;
}

.menu ul{
    list-style:none;
    display:flex;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
}

.menu ul li{
    margin-left:25px;
}

.menu ul li a{
    text-decoration:none;
    color:white;
    font-size:14px;
    font-weight:bold;
}

.menu ul li a:hover{
    color:#4da6ff;
}

.heroine{
    width:100%;
    min-height:500px;
    background:#444;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-around;
    color:white;
    padding:50px;
}

.heroine-text{
    width:45%;
}

.heroine-text h1{
    font-size:50px;
    margin-bottom:20px;
}

.heroine-text p{
    font-size:18px;
    line-height:1.6;
    margin-bottom:25px;
}

.btn{
    background:#2979ff;
    color:white;
    padding:12px 25px;
    text-decoration:none;
    border-radius:5px;
    font-weight:bold;
    display:inline-block;
}

.btn:hover{
    background:#005ce6;
}

.heroine-image img{
    width:350px;
    max-width:100%;
    border-radius:10px;
}


.about{
    width:100%;
    background:white;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-around;
    padding:60px;
}

.about-image img{
    width:300px;
    max-width:100%;
    border-radius:10px;
}

.about-text{
    width:50%;
}

.about-text h2{
    font-size:40px;
    margin-bottom:15px;
    color:#222;
}

.line{
    width:80px;
    height:4px;
    background:#2979ff;
    margin-bottom:20px;
}

.about-text p{
    font-size:16px;
    color:#555;
    line-height:1.8;
    margin-bottom:20px;
}

@media(max-width:768px){

    .navbar{
        flex-direction:column;
        text-align:center;
        padding:15px;
    }

    .menu ul{
        flex-direction:column;
        margin-top:15px;
    }

    .menu ul li{
        margin:10px 0;
    }

    .hero{
        flex-direction:column;
        text-align:center;
        padding:40px 20px;
    }

    .heroine-text{
        width:100%;
    }

    .heroine-text h1{
        font-size:36px;
    }

    .heroine-image{
        margin-top:30px;
    }

    .hero-image img{
        width:250px;
    }

    .about{
        flex-direction:column;
        text-align:center;
        padding:40px 20px;
    }

    .about-image{
        margin-bottom:20px;
    }

    .about-text{
        width:100%;
    }

    .about-text h2{
        font-size:32px;
    }

    .line{
        margin:0 auto 20px;
    }
}

</style>

</head>
<body>

<div class="navbar">

    <div class="logo">
        <h2>Online Portfolio</h2>
        <p>Just another My Blog site</p>
    </div>

    <div class="menu">
        <ul>
            <li><a href="#">HOME</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">ABOUT ME</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">SERVICES</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">SKILL</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">TESTIMONIAL</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">EXPERIENCE</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">WORKS</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">BLOG</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">CONTACT US</a></li>
        </ul>
    </div>

</div>

<section class="heroine">

    <div class="heroine-text">
        <h1>MADRAS PAVITHRA</h1>

        <p>
            Hi, I am a Professional Developer and ICT Degree holder.
            I have five years experience in IT Sector as an ICT Lecturer.
        </p>

        <a href="#" class="btn">Hire Me</a>
    </div>

    <div class="heroine-image">
        <img src="HD.png" alt="Profile">
    </div>

</section>

<section class="about">

    <div class="about-image">
        <img src="HD.png" alt="About Image">
    </div>

    <div class="about-text">

        <h2>ABOUT ME</h2>

        <div class="line"></div>

        <p>
            I am a developer who blends expertise with industry knowledge
            to build innovative and efficient software solutions.
        </p>

        <p>
            Software Developers use programming languages and tools to
            design, develop, test, and maintain applications. They follow
            the Software Development Life Cycle (SDLC) to ensure quality
            and reliability.
        </p>

        <a href="#" class="btn">DOWNLOAD RESUME</a>

    </div>

</section>

</body>
</html>
